37
00:01:33,990 --> 00:01:39,820
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Infiltrate:</font>

38
00:01:33,990 --> 00:01:39,820
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the Set Trap</font>

39
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How is she?</font>

40
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:56,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know why
she suddenly collapsed...</font>

41
00:01:57,220 --> 00:01:57,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

42
00:01:58,970 --> 00:02:01,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The collection ships depart
in the morning.</font>

43
00:02:01,970 --> 00:02:03,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should get back to the inn.</font>

44
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:06,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But then,
what will happen to Isaribi?</font>

45
00:02:07,020 --> 00:02:09,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who cares?
She's the Demon of the Ocean!</font>

46
00:02:10,150 --> 00:02:11,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

47
00:02:11,770 --> 00:02:14,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, what in the world happened
with you and that girl?</font>

48
00:02:14,730 --> 00:02:19,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aw, c'mon! I told you
a little while ago, she saved me!</font>

49
00:02:54,020 --> 00:02:55,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?</font>

50
00:02:56,730 --> 00:02:58,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, my hand slipped.</font>

51
00:02:59,820 --> 00:03:00,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

52
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:08,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll clean this up right away.</font>

53
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:09,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anko.</font>

54
00:03:09,710 --> 00:03:10,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes?</font>

55
00:03:11,210 --> 00:03:15,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The studies here,
the Hokage knows about them.</font>

56
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand.</font>

57
00:03:27,930 --> 00:03:31,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, you're saying that this girl
named Isaribi saved you?</font>

58
00:03:31,890 --> 00:03:35,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I owe my life to her.</font>

59
00:03:35,770 --> 00:03:40,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if that's so, there's no doubt
that this girl named Isaribi</font>

60
00:03:40,450 --> 00:03:43,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was one of the people
who attacked us.</font>

61
00:03:44,570 --> 00:03:47,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our mission is to protect
the government's money</font>

62
00:03:47,740 --> 00:03:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and catch the Demon of the Ocean.</font>

63
00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:52,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, and no matter
how you look at it,</font>

64
00:03:52,460 --> 00:03:54,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no doubt that
she's the Demon of the Ocean!</font>

65
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, but I think there's some reason
for all that.</font>

66
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to follow her and...!</font>

67
00:03:59,380 --> 00:04:00,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're talking nonsense.</font>

68
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:03,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, even if we were to follow her,
we've got no idea where she is.</font>

69
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I have one.</font>

70
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really, Shino?</font>

71
00:04:07,350 --> 00:04:09,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's something I heard.</font>

72
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:12,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems there's one island
in this country</font>

73
00:04:12,100 --> 00:04:14,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that played a role in a series
of spiriting away incidents.</font>

74
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:15,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is it?!</font>

75
00:04:15,940 --> 00:04:18,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A deserted island where
the Demon of the Ocean lives,</font>

76
00:04:18,650 --> 00:04:19,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Demon Island.</font>

77
00:04:20,030 --> 00:04:21,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Demon Island?</font>

78
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:23,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei, are you doing okay?</font>

79
00:04:23,990 --> 00:04:26,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, more importantly,</font>

80
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:29,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's something I want to tell you
about the Demon of the Ocean.</font>

81
00:04:29,660 --> 00:04:32,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The true identity of this thing called
the Demon of the Ocean</font>

82
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:35,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is a human whose flesh
has been altered.</font>

83
00:04:35,370 --> 00:04:36,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

84
00:04:36,790 --> 00:04:37,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?</font>

85
00:04:56,850 --> 00:04:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't muck things up like that again.</font>

86
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:00,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir.</font>

87
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's out, the monster!</font>

88
00:05:35,020 --> 00:05:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?</font>

89
00:05:35,810 --> 00:05:38,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Get out of here.
— You're bad luck.</font>

90
00:05:38,150 --> 00:05:39,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

91
00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:43,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's the one who was spirited away.</font>

92
00:05:43,730 --> 00:05:45,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And why would she be
the only one who came back?</font>

93
00:06:00,130 --> 00:06:02,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about?</font>

94
00:06:03,170 --> 00:06:06,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A spiriting away that occurred
ten years ago in the Land of Sea,</font>

95
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:09,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but that was not the working
of a demon.</font>

96
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:12,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru kidnapped humans
to use as live subjects</font>

97
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:15,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for his research at the time.</font>

98
00:06:16,310 --> 00:06:17,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru...</font>

99
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:22,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is Orochimaru mixed up
in this current matter?</font>

100
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:25,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait a minute.
Orochimaru and tests!</font>

101
00:06:25,860 --> 00:06:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you suddenly
saying such things?</font>

102
00:06:28,070 --> 00:06:32,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to explain it to you from
when Orochimaru left the village.</font>

103
00:06:33,740 --> 00:06:35,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over ten years ago,</font>

104
00:06:35,290 --> 00:06:40,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru's desire to satisfy his own
inquiring mind and further his power</font>

105
00:06:41,250 --> 00:06:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was such that he gradually
exceeded the scope of a Shinobi</font>

106
00:06:44,130 --> 00:06:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and in the end, got involved in developing
what are called Forbidden Jutsu.</font>

107
00:06:51,890 --> 00:06:53,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How unfortunate.</font>

108
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:59,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naturally, this soon became
known to the village.</font>

109
00:07:02,860 --> 00:07:03,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After Orochimaru!</font>

110
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop that guy!</font>

111
00:07:08,490 --> 00:07:12,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Orochimaru, who travelled
in and out of country on missions...</font>

112
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:17,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">had several other private facilities
outside of the Leaf Village...</font>

113
00:07:17,870 --> 00:07:21,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So one of those is on Demon Island?</font>

114
00:07:22,290 --> 00:07:24,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, the people who disappeared?</font>

115
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:27,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were used for
human experiments.</font>

116
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

117
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:32,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn Orochimaru!
What does he think people are?</font>

118
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:34,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, what are we going to do?</font>

119
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:37,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's obvious, isn't it?
We get into their hideout!</font>

120
00:07:37,350 --> 00:07:39,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And we have to get Isaribi back!</font>

121
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's settled.</font>

122
00:07:42,850 --> 00:07:45,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll continue and hit
the Demon of the Ocean's hideout.</font>

123
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:56,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei, how long have you known
about Demon Island?</font>

124
00:07:57,620 --> 00:08:01,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because Orochimaru
was the Jonin in charge of me.</font>

125
00:08:04,670 --> 00:08:06,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tell me when we get close
to the island.</font>

126
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:12,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The pain is gradually getting stronger.</font>

127
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:16,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somebody's coming.</font>

128
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What shall we do?</font>

129
00:08:20,220 --> 00:08:21,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do as you please.</font>

130
00:08:21,890 --> 00:08:22,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

131
00:08:27,110 --> 00:08:30,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The arrogance...
One day I'll pay him back!</font>

132
00:08:39,990 --> 00:08:40,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way.</font>

133
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry!</font>

134
00:08:52,050 --> 00:08:53,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How is it, Shino?</font>

135
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:54,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No problem.</font>

136
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:56,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

137
00:09:05,230 --> 00:09:07,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, a collection ship
is on the move, huh?</font>

138
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:09,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just the right time.</font>

139
00:09:09,820 --> 00:09:13,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good work, I was right to send you
back to Mother Island.</font>

140
00:09:14,450 --> 00:09:17,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong? You're pale.</font>

141
00:09:18,740 --> 00:09:22,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When will I return to normal?</font>

142
00:09:23,410 --> 00:09:26,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like you said, I've gathered
information about the ships</font>

143
00:09:26,250 --> 00:09:29,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the market
and the village, even the attacks.</font>

144
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So...</font>

145
00:09:30,750 --> 00:09:33,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you bringing up, Isaribi?</font>

146
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:39,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't possibly have forgotten
your role as a prototype.</font>

147
00:09:39,930 --> 00:09:43,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a converted body,
your cooperation in generating data...</font>

148
00:09:44,270 --> 00:09:47,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was one
of the conditions of the promise.</font>

149
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:52,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry, we'll soon be done
getting data from you.</font>

150
00:09:52,150 --> 00:09:57,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll keep the promise...
as long as I don't change my mind.</font>

151
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You understand, right?</font>

152
00:09:59,120 --> 00:09:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

153
00:10:00,450 --> 00:10:04,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, if you understand,
go keep our guests company.</font>

154
00:10:04,910 --> 00:10:05,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand...</font>

155
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:11,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're vicious, too.</font>

156
00:10:17,130 --> 00:10:19,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no sign of 'em.</font>

157
00:10:31,650 --> 00:10:33,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this?</font>

158
00:10:34,070 --> 00:10:36,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Birds, no fish?</font>

159
00:10:46,830 --> 00:10:47,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't move!</font>

160
00:10:48,330 --> 00:10:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad, isn't it?</font>

161
00:10:50,250 --> 00:10:52,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess with Shinobi
from the Leaf Village.</font>

162
00:10:56,550 --> 00:10:57,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, little...!</font>

163
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:12,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, well,
aren't these cute kitties?</font>

164
00:11:26,950 --> 00:11:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is everyone okay?</font>

165
00:11:28,450 --> 00:11:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yep.</font>

166
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:39,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As always, you people
are addicted to peace.</font>

167
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:41,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're from last evening!</font>

168
00:11:42,090 --> 00:11:44,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your face looks familiar.</font>

169
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:49,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chunin Exams,
if I remember correctly.</font>

170
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

171
00:11:57,570 --> 00:11:59,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I recall, Sasuke's adversary!</font>

172
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:02,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The guy who was with
that Kabuto?!</font>

173
00:12:02,820 --> 00:12:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are correct...</font>

174
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:07,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course,
I haven't seen him since then.</font>

175
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:11,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You used a strange Jutsu
to suck up other's Chakras.</font>

176
00:12:11,620 --> 00:12:14,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the guy who sucked up
all of Sasuke's strength.</font>

177
00:12:16,290 --> 00:12:20,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, all of you, come at me.
I'm different than I was then.</font>

178
00:12:20,340 --> 00:12:23,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, I'll finish you off right now!</font>

179
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:25,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Naruto!</font>

180
00:12:25,390 --> 00:12:26,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino?</font>

181
00:12:26,890 --> 00:12:30,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You go ahead.
Seems like I'm the opponent for him.</font>

182
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:36,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His Jutsu is not suited for
your style of close combat.</font>

183
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't have all three of us stay here.</font>

184
00:12:40,570 --> 00:12:41,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

185
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:43,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— We're counting on you, Shino!
— Be careful!</font>

186
00:12:44,660 --> 00:12:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

187
00:12:49,830 --> 00:12:51,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Parasitic Insects, eh?</font>

188
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:21,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Found him!</font>

189
00:13:29,700 --> 00:13:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who?</font>

190
00:13:35,370 --> 00:13:39,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome, or should I say,
haven't seen you in a while?</font>

191
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:43,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's you, Amachi.</font>

192
00:13:44,470 --> 00:13:45,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm surprised!</font>

193
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:50,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe you've come back
after something like that happened...</font>

194
00:13:50,970 --> 00:13:51,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like what?</font>

195
00:13:53,020 --> 00:13:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't remember?</font>

196
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but I have no business
with you...</font>

197
00:13:57,140 --> 00:13:58,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is Orochimaru?</font>

198
00:13:59,860 --> 00:14:01,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru?</font>

199
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't play dumb.
He's here, isn't he?</font>

200
00:14:07,030 --> 00:14:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Curse Mark responds even
though the operator isn't around...</font>

201
00:14:10,030 --> 00:14:11,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stuff like that happens, huh?</font>

202
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:14,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True, Orochimaru was here...</font>

203
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:18,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that was over a month and a half ago.</font>

204
00:14:18,670 --> 00:14:19,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way.</font>

205
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:22,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter if you don't
believe me.</font>

206
00:14:23,170 --> 00:14:25,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the pain I felt so far...</font>

207
00:14:25,510 --> 00:14:28,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">has been the influence of Orochimaru's
presence here a month and a half ago?</font>

208
00:14:29,930 --> 00:14:31,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait a minute.</font>

209
00:14:32,550 --> 00:14:33,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!</font>

210
00:14:33,510 --> 00:14:34,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You two!</font>

211
00:14:34,810 --> 00:14:36,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my, you brought Genin.</font>

212
00:14:36,980 --> 00:14:40,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anko, you're all grown up...</font>

213
00:14:40,350 --> 00:14:41,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is that?</font>

214
00:14:42,110 --> 00:14:45,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Amachi... a Medical Ninja
who partnered with Orochimaru,</font>

215
00:14:45,530 --> 00:14:47,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and was running
various experiments here.</font>

216
00:14:48,110 --> 00:14:53,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru's not here.
This whole incident was all his doing.</font>

217
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:55,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Him?!</font>

218
00:14:56,290 --> 00:14:59,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you! How dare you run
those ridiculous tests!</font>

219
00:14:59,670 --> 00:15:05,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ridiculous? This is no joke,
I've devoted my life to this research.</font>

220
00:15:05,590 --> 00:15:06,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?!</font>

221
00:15:07,130 --> 00:15:11,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look! This one has the physical ability
to adapt to water.</font>

222
00:15:12,050 --> 00:15:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She combines the ability
to breathe underwater</font>

223
00:15:13,930 --> 00:15:16,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the muscle strength
to move freely and quickly.</font>

224
00:15:17,220 --> 00:15:19,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been a dream of mine
for many years,</font>

225
00:15:19,350 --> 00:15:21,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to form a Ninja corps
for underwater combat.</font>

226
00:15:21,650 --> 00:15:22,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the first step.</font>

227
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:25,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Ninja corps for underwater combat?</font>

228
00:15:25,770 --> 00:15:29,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, a military corps able
to move freely underwater</font>

229
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:31,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that the common person
definitely could not imitate.</font>

230
00:15:31,860 --> 00:15:34,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When that happens,
we can divide land and land</font>

231
00:15:34,450 --> 00:15:37,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and completely control
marine shipping routes!</font>

232
00:15:37,450 --> 00:15:39,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wonderful, is it not?</font>

233
00:15:39,250 --> 00:15:41,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this strength,
I'll stand on top of the world.</font>

234
00:15:42,250 --> 00:15:47,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I'll make Orochimaru regret
abandoning this research.</font>

235
00:15:48,210 --> 00:15:51,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People are not your tools!</font>

236
00:15:51,090 --> 00:15:53,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my, you're so young,</font>

237
00:15:53,430 --> 00:15:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you don't understand the greatness
of this research...</font>

238
00:15:57,010 --> 00:16:00,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you're average guinea pigs
who don't know any better,</font>

239
00:16:00,730 --> 00:16:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I don't think I want you to understand.</font>

240
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:04,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bastard!</font>

241
00:16:11,650 --> 00:16:13,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's good, Isaribi.</font>

242
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out of the way, Isaribi!</font>

243
00:16:15,370 --> 00:16:16,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

244
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:26,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong? You can't fight
by just running around in circles.</font>

245
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:37,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

246
00:16:40,810 --> 00:16:43,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you protecting that guy?</font>

247
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:45,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy did this to you, Isaribi!</font>

248
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:46,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, but...!</font>

249
00:16:47,860 --> 00:16:49,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it can't be helped.</font>

250
00:16:50,110 --> 00:16:53,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the only person who can
return my body back to normal.</font>

251
00:16:54,150 --> 00:16:55,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He promised.</font>

252
00:16:56,620 --> 00:16:57,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look.</font>

253
00:17:01,250 --> 00:17:02,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isaribi...</font>

254
00:17:03,370 --> 00:17:07,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People are judged based solely
on their appearance.</font>

255
00:17:08,590 --> 00:17:12,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People don't dare come near me
just from being covered in bandages...</font>

256
00:17:12,630 --> 00:17:15,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A monster with these scales
would be out of the question.</font>

257
00:17:16,130 --> 00:17:19,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to return to my former body,
I want to be a human!</font>

258
00:17:20,140 --> 00:17:22,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For that reason,
I decided I'd do anything!</font>

259
00:17:23,060 --> 00:17:26,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a human being even now, Isaribi!</font>

260
00:17:27,350 --> 00:17:31,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And yet you join with those guys
to attack and sink ships.</font>

261
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:35,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that far more like something
a monster would do?!</font>

262
00:17:35,650 --> 00:17:37,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it, shut up!</font>

263
00:17:38,620 --> 00:17:39,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I...</font>

264
00:17:39,910 --> 00:17:42,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to hear it!
Shut up, shut up!</font>

265
00:17:42,490 --> 00:17:46,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it! Are you bullying me, too?</font>

266
00:17:47,250 --> 00:17:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... I... I'm the same as you!</font>

267
00:17:53,260 --> 00:17:54,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're lying!</font>

268
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:58,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about?
You're a normal human.</font>

269
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to be like you, too!</font>

270
00:18:06,020 --> 00:18:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't cry, Isaribi...
I'll properly return you to normal.</font>

271
00:18:13,530 --> 00:18:14,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watch out!</font>

272
00:18:22,740 --> 00:18:24,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A bullseye letter bomb.</font>

273
00:18:25,450 --> 00:18:28,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks to Isaribi doing a good job
of attracting your attention.</font>

274
00:18:32,090 --> 00:18:33,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei...</font>

275
00:18:34,050 --> 00:18:35,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll leave the rest to you.</font>

276
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

277
00:18:36,470 --> 00:18:37,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Isaribi.</font>

278
00:18:38,930 --> 00:18:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

279
00:18:42,010 --> 00:18:44,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't go, Isaribi!</font>

280
00:18:47,100 --> 00:18:48,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

281
00:18:51,810 --> 00:18:54,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'd better take care of
this right away.</font>

282
00:18:54,820 --> 00:18:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give it up... It's over.</font>

283
00:18:57,360 --> 00:19:00,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll make you a guinea pig
for Amachi, too.</font>

284
00:19:03,530 --> 00:19:04,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Insect clone?!</font>

285
00:19:05,620 --> 00:19:07,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're the same
Chakra-eating colleagues, after all.</font>

286
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't be easy to finish a fight.</font>

287
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:17,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He disappeared?</font>

288
00:19:19,930 --> 00:19:21,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is he thinking?</font>

289
00:19:25,390 --> 00:19:26,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There you go!</font>

290
00:19:27,390 --> 00:19:28,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

291
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:32,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to strangle you
to death like this.</font>

292
00:19:43,120 --> 00:19:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?!</font>

293
00:19:51,120 --> 00:19:53,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mind Destruction Jutsu, a success.</font>

294
00:20:00,550 --> 00:20:03,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, you did it, Ino!</font>

295
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:06,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Let me go, let me go!</font>

296
00:20:07,220 --> 00:20:08,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's dirty of you!</font>

297
00:20:08,850 --> 00:20:10,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about?</font>

298
